sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as 临床用户
    participant W as 企业微信
    participant G as WeCom Gateway
    participant I as Intake Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant T as Tickets
    participant O as Outbox Relay
    participant A as AI/OCR

    U->>W: @信息保障助手 + 文字/截图
    W->>G: WebSocket Frame
    G->>I: POST /internal/v1/intakes/wecom
    I->>DB: 幂等检查 + 保存消息/Intake
    I->>T: 创建工单(Idempotency-Key)
    T-->>I: ticket_no + QUEUED
    I->>DB: 写Outbox并提交事务
    I-->>G: 工单号/首次回复模板
    G-->>W: 回复“已生成工单，等待受理”
    W-->>U: 首次确认
    I--)A: 异步规则/OCR/AI
    A-->>I: 结构化建议
    T->>DB: 接单/处理/解决 + 事件 + Outbox
    O->>G: 发送申报人单聊
    G->>W: 主动推送
    W->>U: 进度卡片
